@event crisis_collapse
# en: Collapse
title [59ccfe] = 倒下
# en: The world tilts. When it rights itself you are in the infirmary, and Sister Amaranth is looking at you over her spectacles. "You have been running your body like a borrowed broom," she says.
text [f87609] = 世界倾斜了。等它恢复正常时，你已经躺在医务室里，阿玛兰斯修女正从眼镜上方看着你。“你对待自己的身体，就像对待一把借来的飞帚。”她说。
# en: A narrow infirmary bed under a high arched window, a healer's lamp floating beside it.
scene [27d146] = 高高的拱窗下一张窄窄的病床，旁边悬浮着一盏治疗师的灯。
# en: Pay for the full cure (30 gold)
opt.left.label [97a3e9] = 付钱彻底治好（30 金币）
# en: Three foul tonics and two days' sleep later, you feel almost human.
opt.left.say.1 [ecd52f] = 三剂难喝的药和两天的睡眠之后，你感觉差不多像个人了。
# en: You can't pay. She heals you anyway, slowly, and you miss a fortnight of classes.
opt.left.say.2 [a936d1] = 你付不起。她还是给你治了，只是慢一些，你缺了两周的课。
# en: Ask to rest instead
opt.right.label [8eabcd] = 请求静养
# en: A long, dull fortnight in bed. Sister Amaranth warns you: "Next time, I write to your family."
opt.right.say.1 [b20134] = 在床上躺了漫长而无聊的两周。阿玛兰斯修女警告你：“下次，我就写信给你家里。”

@event crisis_despair
# en: The Grey
title [9c424f] = 灰色
# en: Everything has gone grey. You have packed your trunk twice this week and unpacked it once. It would be so easy to take the next barge and simply stop.
text [02373b] = 一切都变成了灰色。这周你收拾了两次行李，又拆开了一次。坐上下一班驳船，就此停下，是多么容易。
# en: A student sitting on the edge of a dormitory bed, rain on the window, a packed trunk by the door.
scene [dc74cf] = 一个学生坐在宿舍床沿，窗上有雨，门边放着收拾好的行李箱。
# en: Reach out to someone
opt.left.label [e2c5e9] = 向别人伸出手
# en: You knock on a friend's door. They don't ask questions. They just make tea, and stay.
opt.left.say.1 [5f5838] = 你敲响了朋友的门。对方什么也没问。只是泡了茶，陪着你。
# en: Old Maud finds you in the gardens and puts a trowel in your hand. "Dig," she says. You dig. It helps more than it should.
opt.left.say.2 [a27142] = 老莫德在花园里找到你，把一把小铲子塞进你手里。“挖。”她说。你挖了。这比想象中更有用。
# en: You talk to the night porter, of all people. He tells you about his own first year. It's enough, for now.
opt.left.say.3 [26f9c5] = 你竟然和守夜门房聊了起来。他给你讲了他自己的一年级。暂时，这就够了。
# en: Take the next barge
opt.right.label [c52bdf] = 坐下一班驳船
# en: You get as far as the landing. The barge is late. By the time it arrives, you have decided to stay one more month.
opt.right.say.1 [d9e779] = 你走到了码头。驳船晚点了。等它到的时候，你决定再留一个月。

@event crisis_probation
# en: The Disciplinary Board
title [f764c3] = 纪律委员会
# en: Your standing has collapsed. You are summoned before the Disciplinary Board: three professors and the headmistress, who looks at you with an expression of deep, patient disappointment.
text [64e11f] = 你的学业一落千丈。你被传唤到纪律委员会面前：三位教授和院长，院长看着你的表情里满是深沉而耐心的失望。
# en: Three faculty members behind a high bench in a dim chamber; the headmistress in the centre, hands folded.
scene [1c27f2] = 昏暗的厅堂里，三位教职员坐在高高的长桌后；院长居中，双手交握。
# en: Plead your case (Charm)
opt.left.label [12e1aa] = 为自己辩护（魅力）
# en: You speak honestly and well. They grant you probation. "Do not make us regret it."
opt.left.say.1 [500054] = 你说得诚恳而得体。他们准许你留校察看。“别让我们后悔。”
# en: You stammer. They grant probation anyway, but the headmistress's sigh will haunt you.
opt.left.say.2 [b13084] = 你结结巴巴。他们还是准许了留校察看，但院长的那声叹息会一直萦绕在你心头。
# en: Promise to work harder
opt.right.label [a78172] = 保证会更努力
# en: "Promises are cheap," says Professor Thorne. "We'll take it anyway." Probation.
opt.right.say.1 [b382bf] = “承诺不值钱，”索恩教授说，“不过我们还是收下了。”留校察看。

@event grisk_collectors
# en: Grisk's Collectors
title [eb1401] = 格里斯克的讨债人
# en: Two trolls in waistcoats are waiting outside your dormitory. "Mister Grisk," says the larger one, "is disappointed." The smaller one cracks his knuckles, which sounds like a rockslide.
text [6dfc11] = 两个穿马甲的巨魔等在你的宿舍外。“格里斯克先生，”大个子说，“很失望。”小个子把指关节捏得咔咔响，听起来像山崩。
# en: Two large trolls in ill-fitting waistcoats looming in a dormitory doorway, one holding a ledger.
scene [8592b2] = 两个穿着不合身马甲的高大巨魔堵在宿舍门口，其中一个拿着账簿。
# en: Hand over everything you have
opt.left.label [eec2ea] = 交出所有的钱
# en: They count your purse twice and declare the debt settled. "Pleasure," says the large one, meaning it.
opt.left.say.1 [377b97] = 他们把你的钱袋数了两遍，宣布债务两清。“荣幸。”大个子说，是真心的。
# en: They take every coin and your good boots. "Partial," they say, and leave.
opt.left.say.2 [a2fe22] = 他们拿走了每一枚硬币和你最好的靴子。“部分还款。”他们说完就走了。
# en: Run
opt.right.label [57e66a] = 逃跑
# en: You escape across the rooftops. They'll be back, but not this month.
opt.right.say.1 [24257a] = 你从屋顶上逃走了。他们还会回来，但不是这个月。
# en: You do not escape. The trolls are surprisingly gentle about breaking only one rib.
opt.right.say.2 [0374eb] = 你没逃掉。巨魔们出人意料地温柔，只断了你一根肋骨。
